    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from At and T Enterprises?",
      "a": "The Department of Veterans Affairs, the Department of Homeland Security, and the Department of Justice are the top buyers. The Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $335M, the Department of Homeland Security obligated $176M, and the Department of Justice obligated $154M in FY2026 to date. Other buyers include the Department of the Treasury at $78.6M and the Department of Transportation at $52.7M."
